<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>Complaint Received | Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">

  <style>
    .confirmation-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #e9e2d0;
      padding: 0 20px 60px;
    }

    .confirmation-header {
      background: #10283e;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #c69c45;
      margin: 0 -20px;
    }

    .confirmation-header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .confirmation-card {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 60px auto;
      background: #fffaf0;
      border: 2px solid #c69c45;
      padding: 45px;
      text-align: center;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .confirmation-card h2 {
      color: #10283e;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .confirmation-card p {
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .confirmation-card .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .confirmation-card {
        padding: 25px 20px;
        margin-top: 30px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="confirmation-page">

    <header class="confirmation-header">
      <h1>WATLINGTON SPORTS &amp; SOCIAL CLUB</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="confirmation-card">

      <h2>Complaint Submitted Successfully</h2>

      <p>
        Thank you for contacting
        Watlington Sports &amp; Social Club.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your formal complaint has been submitted
        successfully and will be reviewed by
        authorised committee officers.
      </p>

      <p>
        We will contact you using the email address
        provided if further information is required
        or to advise you of the outcome.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your complaint will be handled confidentially,
        subject to information sharing necessary
        for a fair investigation, safeguarding
        or legal obligations.
      </p>

      <a href="/" class="btn btn-brass">
        Return to Homepage
      </a>

    </div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
